      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge ds-ready\">Готова к работе</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-workable\">Можно уточнить</span> <span class=\"ds-badge ds-draft\">Черновик</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:'Manrope Variable',Manrope,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:5px;font-size:9px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;white-space:nowrap;background:#eef2e9;color:#5c6b50;}.ds-ready{background:#e9f1eb;color:#346449;}.ds-workable{background:#f6efd9;color:#80652c;}.ds-draft{background:#f0f0ed;color:#69706a;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "task-card",
      "description": "Full-card link: content preview, labeled score and progress. Sample data is illustrative.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#task\"><span class=\"ds-topic\">Аналитика</span><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Понятный отчёт по продажам</h3><p class=\"ds-excerpt\">Собрать данные в удобный отчёт для команды.</p><div class=\"ds-card-score\"><span>Готова к работе</span><strong>72 / 100</strong></div><div class=\"ds-track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Готовность задачи\" aria-valuenow=\"72\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"><span class=\"ds-fill\"></span></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:'Manrope Variable',Manrope,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e3e8e1);background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius,14px);color:var(--ink,#25372f);text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .18s,background .18s;}.ds-card:hover{border-color:#a2b695;background:#fdfefb;}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#467958);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-topic{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#65775b;margin-bottom:22px;}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.02em;}.ds-excerpt{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#5d6b60);}.ds-card-score{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:10px;margin:26px 0 11px;}.ds-card-score strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:750;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-track{height:4px;border-radius:4px;background:#edf0e8;overflow:hidden;}.ds-fill{display:block;width:72%;height:100%;background:#769a59;border-radius:inherit;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rating Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "rating",
      "description": "Server-driven rating presentation with a save reminder when dirty. Sample score is illustrative.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-rating\"><h2 class=\"ds-rating-title\">Готовность задачи</h2><strong class=\"ds-total\">72<span> / 100</span></strong><div class=\"ds-rating-track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Общий рейтинг\" aria-valuenow=\"72\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"><span class=\"ds-rating-fill\"></span></div><p class=\"ds-rating-copy\">Сохраните изменения, чтобы обновить рейтинг.</p><p class=\"ds-rating-footnote\">Любую задачу можно опубликовать — даже с небольшим рейтингом.</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-rating{font-family:'Manrope Variable',Manrope,sans-serif;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line,#e3e8e1);border-radius:var(--radius,14px);padding:23px;color:var(--ink,#25372f);}.ds-rating-title{margin:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:-.025em;}.ds-total{display:block;margin:20px 0 15px;font-weight:600;font-size:43px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-total span{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted,#5d6b60);}.ds-rating-track{height:7px;background:#edf0e8;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-rating-fill{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;background:#769a59;transform:scaleX(.72);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-rating-copy{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#5d6b60);}.ds-rating-footnote{font-size:9px;line-height:1.8;padding-top:15px;margin:17px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e3e8e1);color:var(--muted,#5d6b60);}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-rating-fill{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Shared project studio",
    "overview": "White work surfaces, a grey-green canvas, forest actions and restrained lime accents make a practical workspace for business representatives and student teams. Typography, borders and spacing carry the hierarchy; icons support actions and no raster imagery ships.\n\nThis is a descriptive record of the implemented MVP, based on `frontend/src/styles.css`, shared components and pages. The studio metaphor, Russian copy and name «Практика» are working assumptions from the direction contract, not an approved standing identity.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Quiet, bordered work surfaces.",
      "One Manrope family with clear numerical hierarchy.",
      "Explicit save, confirmation and publication states.",
      "Scores explain readiness without restricting participation."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use labels and numeric values alongside state colors and bars.",
      "Do preserve the visible distinction between unsaved, saved, confirmed and published work.",
      "Do keep full explanations on detail surfaces when catalog previews are clamped.",
      "Do retain keyboard focus treatment and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't present the demo role switch as authentication or local task history as ownership.",
      "Don't turn a low readiness score into a publishing or proposal restriction.",
      "Don't replace API loading or error states with invented activity.",
      "Don't treat the working name or studio metaphor as user-approved standing branding."
    ]
  }
}
